div
  section(className="w-full px-6 pt-12 pb-8 border-b border-[#1a1a1a]")
    div(className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#262626] text-[#888] text-[11px] font-mono tracking-wide")
      span(className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-xs bg-white animate-pulse")
      span OCTANE · BEAST · TSRX · VITE — PRODUCTION-GRADE DEMOS
    h1(className="text-[40px] sm:text-[56px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.95] mt-6 text-white max-w-[720px]")
      span Compelling demos,
      span(className="block text-[#888]") usage examples, and guides.
    p(className="text-[15px] text-[#888] leading-relaxed max-w-[560px] mt-4") Four substantial showcases of Octane's granular reactivity, auto-cancelling async, zero-config virtualization and universal suspend/resume — each on its own Vite route. No colors. Just content.
    div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-6
      a(className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-white font-medium text-[13px] hover:bg-[var(--accent-1-hover)] transition" href="/canvas") Explore Canvas
      a(className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#262626] text-[#ededed] font-medium text-[13px] hover:bg-[#111] transition" href="/form") Try Async Form
