  section(className="w-full px-6 pb-12")
    div(className="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-xs overflow-hidden")
      a(className="group bg-black p-6 hover:bg-[#0a0a0a] transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/canvas")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-white grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-1") →
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#111] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666]") /canvas
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-white group-hover:text-white transition") 01 — Real-Time Collaborative Canvas
          p(className="text-[13px] text-[#666] mt-1 leading-relaxed") Superior reactivity and fine-grained state sync. Only re-renders changed pixels, not entire canvas. WebSocket delta sync, presence cursors, 60fps strokes.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") useState + effect
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") delta sync
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") ResizeObserver
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-black p-6 hover:bg-[#0a0a0a] transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/form")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-white grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ✓
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#111] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666]") /form
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-white group-hover:text-white transition") 02 — Adaptive Form with Validation Streams
          p(className="text-[13px] text-[#666] mt-1 leading-relaxed") Composable async flows and cancellation. Debounced 300ms, cancelOnUpdate, race handling. No manual subscriptions.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") derive + cancel
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") AbortController
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") optimistic UI
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-2 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-black p-6 hover:bg-[#0a0a0a] transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/grid")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-white grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-1") ⊞
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#111] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666]") /grid
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-white group-hover:text-white transition") 03 — Virtualized Masonry Grid
          p(className="text-[13px] text-[#666] mt-1 leading-relaxed") Zero-config performance. Built-in virtualization + masonry, ResizeObserver remeasure, 10k+ items, overscan, dynamic heights.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") virtualize
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") ResizeObserver
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") columns
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-black p-6 hover:bg-[#0a0a0a] transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/shell")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-white grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ◈
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#111] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#666]") /shell
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-white group-hover:text-white transition") 04 — Isomorphic Shell with Progressive Hydration
          p(className="text-[13px] text-[#666] mt-1 leading-relaxed") Seamless SSR without hydration mismatches. Same component server + client. suspend/resume, hydration when idle/visible/interaction.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") Hydrate
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") Suspense
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888]") lazy
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-2 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo

  section(className="w-full px-6 pb-12")
    div(className="bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-xs p-6 sm:p-8")
      h2(className="text-[14px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-white flex items-center gap-2")
        span(className="w-1 h-4 bg-white rounded-xs inline-block")
        span How routing works
      p(className="text-[#666] text-[13px] mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-mono") Vite SPA routing with history API. App state tracks window.location.pathname, pushState on navigation, popstate for back/forward. No external router, no page reloads. Direct hits fallback to index.html via Vite appType spa.
      div(className="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-xs overflow-hidden mt-6")
        div(className="bg-black p-4")
          div(className="font-medium text-[13px] text-white") / → Home
          div(className="text-[#666] text-[12px] mt-1 font-mono") Landing + overview
        div(className="bg-black p-4")
          div(className="font-medium text-[13px] text-white") /canvas · /form · /grid · /shell
          div(className="text-[#666] text-[12px] mt-1 font-mono") Each demo isolated, own route, deep-linkable
        div(className="bg-black p-4")
          div(className="font-medium text-[13px] text-white") Vite appType: spa
          div(className="text-[#666] text-[12px] mt-1 font-mono") History fallback in dev + preview
      div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-6
        a(className="px-4 py-2 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-white font-medium text-[13px] hover:bg-[var(--accent-1-hover)]" href="/canvas") Start with Canvas →
